      "widgets_values": [
        "A surrealist oil painting of Salvador Dalí in a dreamlike, semi-medieval, semi-sci-fi environment. Dalí, featuring his iconic long upward-waxed mustache and eccentric, piercing gaze, wears an ornate ensemble merging a medieval velvet doublet with subtle glowing cybernetic accents. He is holding the word \"Krea\" rendered as soft, melting typography—the letters 'KREA' are fluid and dripping like liquid gold over his fingers, in the style of his famous melting clocks. Behind him, ancient gothic cathedral towers and stone arches float seamlessly alongside sleek, futuristic glowing monoliths and holographic planetary rings. The scene is set on an infinite, barren desert landscape under a warm twilight sky with deep, elongated shadows. Masterpiece of surrealism, rich oil on canvas texture, dramatic cinematic lighting."
